{"FixedQueuePool.shutdown sets worker.shutdown=True, causing OrderedQueueWorker.run to stop fetching new items when that flag is set, so each worker can exit without draining its queue, leaving WorkItems unprocessed and their offsets incomplete/uncommitted": 0.8759570717811584, "FixedQueuePool creates each worker queue with queue.Queue() without a maxsize and submits work with put(), allowing unlimited in-memory buffering if processing falls behind consumption, risking memory pressure/OOM under sustained backlog": 0.9010207653045654, "SimpleQueueProcessingStrategy.close stops the commit thread and immediately shuts down the pool without explicitly draining outstanding work and committing the final committable offsets, causing offsets processed shortly before shutdown to remain uncommitted": 0.9407345652580261, "OffsetTracker.get_committable_offsets performs a linear scan over the numeric offset range from the next candidate to max_offset every time it computes committable offsets, adding avoidable CPU overhead in the commit loop with large contiguous in-flight ranges": 0.5677849650382996}